{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"You poke your head through the window to order.|Nobody talks here."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone freezes.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Booth rules.|Follow them."},{"id":"s4","text":"Circle your order.|Press the button."},{"id":"s5","text":"She smiles.|Paper, please."},{"id":"s6","text":"She—"},{"id":"s7","text":"You wait.|The bowl slides through."},{"id":"s8","text":"Hot ramen.|No words needed."},{"id":"s9","text":"Don't talk. Circle it.|That's the booth."},{"id":"n1","text":"No talking.|Order on paper."},{"id":"n2","text":"Press the button.|They bring it."},{"id":"n3","text":"Extra noodles?|Plate on the sensor."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}